# Architecture

## Monorepo

- apps/web-shell - Host MFE
- apps/web-auth - Auth MFE
- apps/mobile - React Native (components colocated in app)
- packages/ui-web - Web design system (@repo/ui)

## Feature Structure

```
features/[name]/
├── components/
├── hooks/
├── services/
│   └── [name].service.ts
├── types/
│   └── [name].types.ts
├── [Name]Page.tsx
└── index.ts
```

## Service Pattern

```typescript
// features/transfers/services/transfer.service.ts
export const transferService = {
  create: (data: TransferData) => apiClient.post('/transfers', data),
  getById: (id: string) => apiClient.get(`/transfers/${id}`),
};
```

## Import Rules

- Features: import from shared/ and @repo/*
- Never import between features
- Export via index.ts public API
- Use @repo/ui for web components (from packages/ui-web)

## When to Extract

- To shared/: Used by 2+ features in same app
- To packages/: Used by 2+ apps

## Package Naming

| Package | Import | Folder |
|---------|--------|--------|
| Web UI | @repo/ui | packages/ui-web |
| TypeScript | @repo/typescript-config | packages/typescript-config |
| ESLint | @repo/eslint-config | packages/eslint-config |

